WEBVTT - Bodyweight Squat Guidance

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
Stand tall with your feet shoulder-width apart and your chest lifted.

00:04.000 --> 00:09.000
Slowly push your hips back and bend your knees toward ninety degrees.

00:09.000 --> 00:14.000
Keep your weight centered over your heels and keep your knees aligned with toes.

00:14.000 --> 00:18.000
Press through your heels to return upright without locking your knees.

00:18.000 --> 00:24.000
Maintain smooth control. When you are ready, we will begin your AI assessment.

